title: Patron Contributions
subtitle: Raise political capital from the Caucus's patrons.
is-card: true
tags: caucus_affairs
card-image: img/card_credits.svg
view-if: contributions_timer <= 0
on-arrival: turn_actions += 1; contributions_timer = 6; last_card_timer = "contributions"
new-page: true
on-display: {! SW.cardStuck(Q, this); !}

= Patron Contributions

Politics in the Galactic Senate runs on favours and credits. The Caucus has friends who can provide both, at a price.

- @core: Appeal to wealthy Core patrons.
- @grassroots: Appeal to the member worlds directly.
- @guilds: Accept a generous offer from guild-linked donors.
- @break: Break with the guilds and return their money.
- @easy_discard
- @set_aside

@core
subtitle: +2 political capital. The Rimward wing dislikes it.
on-arrival: capital += 2; rad_rimward += 7; rad_pacifist += 2

Alderaanian nobles and Chandrilan bankers write generous cheques. The Rimward wing grumbles about "the Caucus of the comfortable".

@grassroots
subtitle: +1 political capital, a little more faith in the Republic and broader support.
on-arrival: capital += 1; faith += 0.5; core_rc += 0.5; colonies_rc += 0.5; midrim_rc += 0.5; outer_rc += 0.5

Small donations pour in from a hundred worlds. It is not much money, but it is a great deal of goodwill.

@guilds
view-if: difficulty < 1 and not integrity_office
subtitle: +3 political capital. The guilds will expect something; the Caucus will not like it.
on-arrival: capital += 3; guild_relation += 4; corruption += 1.5; rad_rimward += 12; rad_pacifist += 4; rad_inst += 3; guild_money += 1; guild_hold += 1

The money arrives through three intermediaries and a charitable foundation on Muunilinst. Nobody asks too many questions. That is rather the point.

@break
view-if: guild_hold > 0
subtitle: −2 political capital. Our hands are free again; the guilds will not forgive it.
choose-if: capital >= 2
unavailable-subtitle: Needs 2 political capital.
on-arrival: {!
Q.capital -= 2; Q.guild_hold = 0; Q.guild_breaks = (Q.guild_breaks || 0) + 1;
Q.guild_relation -= 15; SW.guildPatience(Q, -15, 'the Caucus broke with its guild donors');
Q.rad_rimward -= 5; Q.rad_pacifist -= 3;
Q.guild_leak = Math.random() < 0.35 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.guild_leak) { Q.faith -= 0.5; Q.scandal_ours_until = Q.date + 12; SW.momentum(Q, -0.8, 'the guilds leaking our donations'); }
!}

The Caucus returns every credit the guild foundations gave it, with a public letter. [? if guild_leak : The guilds answer within the hour: every past donation, every intermediary and every thank-you note is on the HoloNet by evening. The Caucus is free, and embarrassed. ?][? if not guild_leak : The guilds say nothing in public. In private, they are already counting what it will cost us. ?]

